 income despite higher pre-tax profit.","Percentages are of revenue; figures may not sum due to rounding."],"report":{"summary":["Applied Materials' revenue grew 4.4% to $28.4B in fiscal 2025 (ended October 26), led by Semiconductor Systems, up 4.5% to $20.8B. Sales to China fell 15.7% to $8.5B, down to 30% of revenue, as export rules tightened.","Operating income rose 5.4% to $8.3B, but net income slipped 2.5% to $7.0B because its tax rate jumped. Capital spending nearly doubled to $2.3B, so free cash flow fell 23.9% to $5.7B, while buybacks rose to $4.9B."],"highlights":["Gross margin rose 1.2 points to 48.7%.","Semiconductor Systems operating income rose 5.7% to $7.4B.","Display operating income rose to $235M from $51M.","Share count fell 3.1%."],"watch":["China revenue fell 15.7%.","Free cash flow fell 23.9% to $5.7B.","Income tax nearly doubled to $2.3B.","Q4 revenue fell 3.5% from a year earlier."],"table":[["Revenue",28.368,27.176,1],["Cost of products sold",14.56,14.279],["Gross profit",13.808,12.897,1],["Operating expenses",5.519,5.03],["Operating income",8.289,7.867,1],["Interest & other, net",0.982,0.285],["Income before taxes",9.271,8.152],["Income tax",2.273,0.975],["Net income",6.998,7.177,1],["Diluted EPS ($)",8.66,8.61,0,"eps"],["Operating cash flow",7.958,8.677],["Free cash flow",5.698,7.487,1]],"sources":[["Applied Materials Q4 and fiscal 2025 results (SEC 8-K)","https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/6951/000162828025051998/exhibit991q42025earningsre.htm"]]},"video":{"revenueLine":{"cap":"Semiconductor Systems was 73% of revenue at $20.8B.","say":"Semiconductor systems made up 73 percent of revenue, at 20.8 billion dollars."},"spotlights":[{"kicker":"China","big":"$8.5B","sub":"China revenue · −15.7%","lines":["30% of revenue, down from 37%","Total revenue +4.4%"],"cap":"China revenue fell 15.7% to $8.5B, 30% of the total.","say":"Revenue from China fell 15.7 percent to 8.5 billion dollars, 30 percent of the total."},{"kicker":"Returns","big":"$6